  "bio": "Ricardo Almeida is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Joinville, Brazil, renowned for his proficient work in illustrative, neotraditional, and dotwork styles. With over a decade of experience in the industry since starting in 2010, Ricardo has honed his craft to deliver exquisite and detailed body art. His professionalism and dedication to his art form are evident in every piece he creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Joinville, Santa Catarina, Brazil"
